    "detailed_description": "In &quot;Crossing Miracles,&quot; you will enter a world where safety is a luxury and zombies lurk around every corner. Developed by creators from northwest China, this game authentically recreates rural architectural environments, giving you a genuine countryside experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThrilling Shooting Experience: Search for weapons within limited time, eliminate zombies, and test your reflexes and combat strategy.<br />\r\nUnique Tricycle Vehicle: Drive a tricycle through a world overrun by zombies, adding endless fun to your adventure.<br />\r\nAuthentic Rural Environment: The game realistically reproduces the architectural environment of northwest China\u2019s rural areas, offering an authentic countryside feel.<br />\r\nDiverse Enemies: Face various types of zombies and experience different surprises and dangers.<br />\r\nStunning 3D Graphics: Enjoy high-quality visuals and smooth gameplay, making you feel like you\u2019re truly immersed.<br />\r\nAre you ready to face the challenge? &quot;Crossing Miracles&quot; will provide you with an unparalleled survival experience. Brave the zombie-infested world and save a desolate countryside!",
    "about_the_game": "In &quot;Crossing Miracles,&quot; you will enter a world where safety is a luxury and zombies lurk around every corner. Developed by creators from northwest China, this game authentically recreates rural architectural environments, giving you a genuine countryside experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThrilling Shooting Experience: Search for weapons within limited time, eliminate zombies, and test your reflexes and combat strategy.<br />\r\nUnique Tricycle Vehicle: Drive a tricycle through a world overrun by zombies, adding endless fun to your adventure.<br />\r\nAuthentic Rural Environment: The game realistically reproduces the architectural environment of northwest China\u2019s rural areas, offering an authentic countryside feel.<br />\r\nDiverse Enemies: Face various types of zombies and experience different surprises and dangers.<br />\r\nStunning 3D Graphics: Enjoy high-quality visuals and smooth gameplay, making you feel like you\u2019re truly immersed.<br />\r\nAre you ready to face the challenge? &quot;Crossing Miracles&quot; will provide you with an unparalleled survival experience. Brave the zombie-infested world and save a desolate countryside!",
    "short_description": "&quot;Crossing Miracles&quot; is a 3D shooter from northwest China, set in a zombie-ravaged post-apocalyptic world. Drive a unique tricycle through a detailed rural setting and battle relentless zombies in a thrilling survival adventure.",
